
Yes — the YouTube-style public website characteristics can be translated into CMP equivalents by treating each consumer-web feature as a control-plane or service-broker capability in a multi-cloud portal. A multicloud management platform typically centralizes provisioning, policy, automation, monitoring, and cost controls behind one interface, which makes this kind of feature mapping natural. [okta](https://www.okta.com/identity-101/multicloud-management-platform/)

