| Mission-driven product identity  [youtube](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AO0pwo7UzfY) | Clear CMP value statement such as “provision, govern, and optimize multi-cloud resources from one control plane,” which aligns with the common role of multicloud platforms.  [youtube](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AO0pwo7UzfY) |
